{{Quote|Hi. Uh, do you mind if we hide in your place for a moment?''"<br />&laquo;''What?''&raquo;<br />"''Ah! Sorry, sir. We have no time.|Kazuda Xiono and Darrb|audio=DarrbXiono-Breakout.flac|<ref name="Subtitles">{{Resistance|Breakout}} {{Subtitles|Disney+}}</ref>}}
The [[Merchant|vendor]] [[Darrb]] resided in a '''house''' on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Varkana]]. In [[34 ABY]], [[Resistance]] operatives [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[Norath Kev]] carried Darrb inside his house and hid inside the dwelling while [[Rescue of Norath Kev|fleeing]] from [[Unidentified First Order stormtrooper 1 (Varkana)|two]] [[Unidentified First Order stormtrooper 2 (Varkana)|stormtroopers]] of the [[First Order]]. The vendor believed the pair were criminals and escaped from their hold by stomping on Kev's [[Limb|foot]], alerting the [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]] to their location. After Xiono and Kev knocked out the two [[trooper]]s, Darrb demanded that they leave his house immediately.

==Description==
The house was located on<ref name="Breakout" /> the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]]<ref name="SWE">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> [[planet]] [[Varkana]] and featured a [[Color|light gray]] door, tan walls, and a rectangular gray rug. The residence also featured several cabinets, shelves, ample counter space, and seating for several individuals. Lighting fixtures and a [[Viewport|window]] helped the house maintain visibility inside.<ref name="Breakout" /> By [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{ResistanceDate|2|13}}</ref> several storage containers were kept near the building's doorway.<ref name="Breakout" />

==History==
{{Quote|Just give us one minute and we are out of here.''"<br />&laquo;''This is absurd. Get out of my house. You're criminals. Help!''&raquo;|quoteend=0|Kazuda Xiono and Darrb|audio=DarrbSilenced-Breakout.flac|<ref name="Subtitles" />}}
[[File:NorathKazudaDarrb-Breakout.png|thumb|right|300px|Kazuda Xiono and Norath Kev hid in Darrb's house to evade stormtroopers and forcibly kept the vendor quiet.]]
By the [[time]] of the [[First Order-Resistance War|war]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]], the [[Gabdorin]] marketplace [[Merchant|vendor]] [[Darrb]] lived in the house.<ref name="Breakout" /> In 34 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> Darrb walked through Varkana's streets toward<ref name="Breakout" /> his<ref name="SWE" /> residence carrying a basket of produce. While trying to [[Rescue of Norath Kev|run]] from [[Unidentified First Order stormtrooper 1 (Varkana)|two]] [[Unidentified First Order stormtrooper 2 (Varkana)|stormtroopers]] of the First Order, the Resistance operatives [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[Norath Kev]] asked the vendor to hide in his dwelling. However, with their pursuers fast approaching, Xiono then expressed that there was no time to wait. The pair carried Darrb inside his home and used their [[Limb|hands]] to keep him from speaking. The vendor angrily panicked, believing they were criminals wanting to [[Thief|rob]] him, and was not reassured by Xiono's promises that they would depart soon.<ref name="Breakout" />

Moments after the two [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]] passed by the house's door, Darrb stomped on Kev's foot and freed himself from the pair's grasp as the latter called out in pain. The stormtroopers&mdash;alerted by Kev's voice&mdash;demanded to enter the dwelling as Kev and Xiono moved to hide, forcing Darrb to stand in front of the room's entrance. When the [[trooper]]s then forcibly made their way inside, they were met with the terrified vendor standing in front of them. When asked about the Resistance operatives, Darrb attempted to discreetly signal that they were still inside, but Xiono and Kev knocked the two troopers out using bowls. The homeowner then demanded that Xiono and Kev leave his residence and threw produce at them as they departed with the stormtroopers' bodies.<ref name="Breakout" />

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:AmletoDarrbHouse-ConceptArt.jpg|thumb|right|300px|Concept artwork of Darrb's house by Aaron Pham]]
Darrb's house first appeared in "[[Breakout]],"<ref name="Breakout" /> the thirteenth episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season Two|second season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', which aired on [[December 22]], [[2019]].<ref name="Disney Press">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref> Prior to the episode's release, the house was first visually depicted in a [[Wikipedia:Disney XD|Disney XD]] [[Wikipedia:YouTube|YouTube]] video posted on [[December 15]] of the same year.<ref name="DisneyXD">{{DisneyXDYouTube|6_8kclcUC5g|New Episodes! &#124; Teaser &#124; Star Wars Resistance &#124; Disney XD}}</ref>

[[Lucasfilm Animation]] artist [[Aaron Pham]] created a concept illustration of the residence titled "verkDomicileAmleto" for "Breakout" on [[May 7]], [[2018]]. The house had originally been designed for [[Amleto]],<ref name="ConceptArt">{{SW|url=breakout-concept-art-gallery|text="Breakout" Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 6}}</ref> an [[Elomin]] [[spy]] included in an earlier version of the episode. However, she was cut from "Breakout" and Darrb took her place in the scene where Xiono and Kev hide in the residence to evade stormtroopers.<ref name="BL Breakout">{{BucketsList|i7ZIrMBvq-I|"Breakout"}}</ref>

